The '''Pokémon Omega Ruby and Pokémon Alpha Sapphire Animated Trailer''' (Japanese: '''『ポケットモンスター オメガルビー・アルファサファイア』 メガスペシャルアニメーション ''' ''Pocket Monsters Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire Mega Special Animation'') is a special {{pkmn|animation|animated}} trailer made to promote the release of {{pkmn|Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire}}.

The trailer aired in Japan on November 16, 2014, later being released on the Japanese ''Pokémon'' [[YouTube]] channel on the same day. The trailer was released on the English ''Pokémon'' YouTube channel on November 20, 2014.

==Plot==
A shot of [[Mt. Chimney]] pans down to [[Littleroot Town]] as a {{p|Taillow}} flies down onto {{ga|Brendan}}'s house. Inside, he is shown to be sleeping in his bed. {{p|Treecko}} appears and climbs up a tree trunk onto a platform, then it jumps on Brendan's face and startles him to wake up, climbs onto his shoulder and laughs. Meanwhile, {{ga|May}} is giving {{p|Mudkip}} a bath with {{p|Torchic}} on her shoulder, in which Mudkip splashes the two before Brendan appears and runs to May's house. The two [[Pokémon Trainer]]s pick up their [[first partner Pokémon]] and smile.

A brief shot of the sky is shown, upon above a {{tc|Youngster}} with a {{p|Zigzagoon}} that are battling against Brendan and his Treecko. On the other hand, May and Torchic are surrounded in [[Petalburg Woods]] by two {{p|Wurmple}}, a {{p|Silcoon}}, a {{p|Cascoon}}, and a {{p|Shroomish}}, before Torchic fires an {{m|Ember}} to scare them away. The scene changes to May and Mudkip in [[Rustboro Gym]] battling against [[Roxanne]] and her {{TP|Roxanne|Nosepass}}, in which Mudkip [[Evolution|evolves]] into {{p|Marshtomp}} mid-battle, exciting May. All three stages of the first partner Pokémon are shown, then transition into a field with May and Brendan with the final stages of the first partner Pokémon. They then [[Mega Evolution|Mega Evolve]] them, showcasing Mega {{p|Sceptile}}, Mega {{p|Blaziken}}, and Mega {{p|Swampert}}.

Various Mega Evolution duos are then shown battling: Mega {{p|Diancie}} and Mega {{p|Gallade}}, Mega {{p|Salamence}} and Mega {{p|Pidgeot}}, Mega {{p|Glalie}} and Mega {{p|Steelix}}, Mega {{p|Camerupt}} and Mega {{p|Beedrill}}, Mega {{p|Slowbro}} and Mega {{p|Sharpedo}}, Mega {{p|Lopunny}} and Mega {{p|Sableye}}, and then Mega {{p|Altaria}} and Mega {{p|Audino}} participating in a {{pkmn|Contest|Pokémon Contest Spectacular}} with May in her [[Contest Costume]].

The scene changes to Brendan with his Mega Sceptile battling against [[Steven Stone]] and his Mega {{TP|Steven|Metagross}}, transitioning to Brendan flying on Mega {{p|Latios}} and May on Mega {{p|Latias}}. Storm clouds appear and [[Primal Reversion|Primal]] {{p|Groudon}} rises from the ground and Primal {{p|Kyogre}} from the sea, to face each other. Rayquaza is then show flying in space, before soaring to the ground in a purple beam of energy becoming Mega {{p|Rayquaza}}. The ending shot features May and Brendan with all the Mega Evolutions and both the Primal Pokémon featured in the short.

