==Trivia==
* This trailer is the most viewed video on The Official Pokémon YouTube channel, with 82.9 million views.
* This is the third trailer of its kind specifically created to promote new games, the [[Pokémon Black Version 2 and Pokémon White Version 2 Animated Trailer|first]] being for [[Pokémon Black and White Versions 2|Pokémon Black 2 and White 2]], the [[Pokémon Mystery Dungeon Animated Shorts|second]] for [[Pokémon Mystery Dungeon: Gates to Infinity]], and the [[Pokémon Masters Animated Trailer|fourth]] for [[Pokémon Masters EX|Pokémon Masters]].
* Although {{me|Blaziken}} was portrayed in the trailer as part of the new [[Mega Evolution]]s for the [[first partner Pokémon]], it actually debuted in {{g|X and Y}}, not {{g|Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire}}.

